<p style="line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; font-size: 12px; margin: 0;" data-start-index="17577" data-end-index="17656"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 24px; text-align: justify; font-size: 12px; margin: 0;" data-start-index="17675" data-end-index="17754"><span style="font-size: 16px;" data-start-index="17754" data-end-index="17785">Lab401 has been working hard over the holidays to add dozens of new products: The <b data-start-index="17867" data-end-index="17870">full range</b> of Proxmark 3 RDV 4.01 accessories, new USB RFID readers, and more.</span></p>
<p style="line-height: 24px; text-align: justify; font-size: 12px; margin: 0;" data-start-index="17675" data-end-index="17754"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 24px; text-align: justify; font-size: 12px; margin: 0;" data-start-index="17675" data-end-index="17754"><span style="font-size: 16px;" data-start-index="17754" data-end-index="17785">Simply use the promo code <strong>B2W2019</strong> to apply your discount.<br></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 24px; text-align: justify; font-size: 12px; margin: 0;" data-start-index="17675" data-end-index="17754"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 24px; text-align: justify; font-size: 12px; margin: 0;" data-start-index="17675" data-end-index="17754"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong>Check out the product</strong> <strong>updates:</strong></span></p>
<ul>
<li><span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong>RFID Pentester Pack </strong><span style="color: #cc0000;"><sup>Updated!</sup></span><br><br>We have overhauled the RFID Pentester Pack, to include the latest Proxmark 3 RDV4.01 Device, Antennas and accessories. All packs come with the SIM/SAM adaptors, and the Full pack has a deep discount.<br><br><a href="https://lab401.com/products/rfid-pentester-pack">Read more ⤑</a><br><br></span></li>
<li><span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong>Proxmark Antenna Update Pack </strong><span style="color: #cc0000;"><sup>New!</sup></span><br><br>The new RDV4.01 has updated antennas, boasting better performance and the new 125KHz Q-Switch and F-Switch.<br>If you've got the RDV 4 - there's no need to buy a new device, you can grab the new antennas at a great price.<br><br><a href="https://lab401.com/collections/rfid-tools/products/proxmark-3-rdv4-01-upgraded-replacement-antenna?lshst=collection">Read more ⤑</a><br></span></li>
<li><span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong>Long Range Antennas </strong><span style="color: #cc0000;"><sup>New!</sup></span><br><br>High performance, <a href="https://lab401.com/collections/rfid-tools/products/proxmark-3-rdv4-long-range-hf-antenna-1">long range 13.56MHz</a> and <a href="https://lab401.com/collections/rfid-tools/products/proxmark-3-rdv4-01-long-range-lf-antenna-pack">125KHz </a>Antennas - delivery highly optimised, long range performance for your in-field operations.<br><br><a href="https://lab401.com/collections/rfid-tools/products/proxmark-3-rdv4-long-range-hf-antenna-1">Read more ⤑</a><br></span></li>
</ul>
<p> </p>
